    <main class="content-card">
        <span class="badge">Billing &amp; Customer Protection</span>
        <h1>Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
        <div class="meta-date">Last updated: October 9, 2026 &bull; Compliant with Paddle Buyer Protection</div>

        <div class="notice-box">
            <strong>14-Day Money-Back Guarantee:</strong> We want you to be completely satisfied with Resume Rater. If our Pro features do not meet your expectations, you may request a full refund within 14 days of your initial subscription purchase.
        </div>

        <h2>1. 14-Day Refund Guarantee</h2>
        <p>We offer a hassle-free 14-day refund policy on first-time Pro subscriptions (both <strong>Pro Monthly at $5/month</strong> and <strong>Pro Annual at $39/year</strong>). If you are not satisfied with the ATS parsing accuracy, radar insights, or candidate evaluation tools, contact us within 14 calendar days of your payment date for a 100% refund.</p>

        <h2>2. Easy Subscription Cancellation</h2>
        <p>You can cancel your subscription renewal at any moment:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Self-Service:</strong> Click the "Manage Subscription" or "Customer Portal" link located inside your Paddle email receipt, or inside the dashboard under usage settings.</li>
            <li><strong>Email Support:</strong> Send a quick cancellation request to <a href="mailto:saadalioffic@gmail.com" style="color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600;">saadalioffic@gmail.com</a> with the email address used during checkout.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>When you cancel, you will not be billed for any subsequent cycles, and you will retain full Pro benefits until the end of your current paid billing period.</p>

        <h2>3. How to Request a Refund</h2>
        <p>To request a refund, please provide your receipt number or transaction ID (provided by Paddle in your email confirmation) using either method:</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Email us directly at: <a href="mailto:saadalioffic@gmail.com" style="color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600;">saadalioffic@gmail.com</a> with subject "Refund Request - [Your Order/Email]".</li>
            <li>Submit a message through our <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600;">Contact Us</a> form specifying your order details.</li>
            <li>Contact Paddle Buyer Support directly via <a href="https://paddle.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600;">paddle.net</a> using your checkout transaction ID.</li>
        </ol>

        <h2>4. Refund Processing Time</h2>
        <p>Once approved, refunds are credited back to your original payment method (Credit Card, Debit Card, PayPal, or Apple/Google Pay) by Paddle within <strong>3 to 5 business days</strong>, depending on your financial institution.</p>

        <h2>5. Exceptions &amp; Abuse</h2>
        <p>Refunds are intended for genuine customer dissatisfaction. We reserve the right to decline repeat refund requests from accounts that systematically purchase and claim refunds in repetitive cycles to bypass quota limits.</p>

        <h2>6. Questions?</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this policy or your billing status, please reach out to us at <a href="mailto:saadalioffic@gmail.com" style="color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600;">saadalioffic@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </main>

